      "created_at": "2016-02-03T21:02:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, has anyone noticed that when using Unload, that firing Prejudice as a result of firing Pride doesn't count as a power usage? I'm not talking about the Prejudice--&gt;Pride--&gt;Prejudice trick. The wording on Pride is that you get to use the power on Prejudice, but firing them both only decrements your \"Use X powers\" counter by one total. Did I miss a ruling, or is this a bug?</p>",
