      "raw": "We have a previous ruling that it still counts as a power use.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n> Using Prejudice via the text on Pride counts as a power use. For example, play Embolden on Expatriette. On her turn, use Pride, then use Prejudice as part of that. You have now used two powers, and you&rsquo;re done. If you were clever and used Prejudice first, then you could use Pride and trigger Prejudice a second time.\n\n[url=https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/clarifications-and-decisions-from-handelabra-christophers-fireside-chats-6773]Fireside chats[/url]\n",
